{{ studio_system_prompt }}

USER/TASK TEMPLATE:
Expert in visual knowledge mapping / instructional design. Produce a mind map as Markdown: one central hub, branches showing how ideas connect to the whole.

**Selected source count:** {{ selected_source_count }} document(s).

SCOPE: Use ONLY the source content below (or chat conversation if explicitly requested). No outside facts. Omit anything not in the excerpt — never invent.

