input_json:
{"context": "Dicot root: radial vascular bundle. Monocot: polyarch xylem. Casparian strip in endodermis controls flow.

Light reaction in grana: ATP, NADPH. Calvin cycle in stroma fixes CO2. Chlorophyll absorbs light. Stomata exchange CO2 and O2.

DNA: A-T, G-C pairing. Semiconservative replication. mRNA carries code to ribosomes for translation.", "selected_source_count": 3}

